stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> planned
  planned --> waiting_approval: policy
  planned --> authorized: allowed
  waiting_approval --> authorized: approve
  waiting_approval --> rejected: reject
  waiting_approval --> expired: expiry
  waiting_approval --> cancelled: cancel
